Not applied (indexing benchmark, 2026-11-11): build the JSON schema validator once per process.
jsonschema.validate() checks the schema against its metaschema on every call; with the warehouse's
schema that is about 21 ms per record (perf/phase-timer.py: 5.2 s of a 250-record batch), the record
itself 0.2 ms. Same result: validate() is check_schema + best_match(iter_errors), as here.
Against metadata-warehouse v1.10.0; apply with `git apply -p1` in the submodule's tree (image build).

